<title>USA: Coventry to sell 9 medical centers to BJC.</title>
<headline>Coventry to sell 9 medical centers to BJC.</headline>
<dateline>NASHVILLE, Tenn. 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Coventry Corp said on Wednesday its Group Health Plan unit agreed in principle to sell its nine medical centers to BJC Health System for an undisclosed sum.</p>
<p>Coventry and BJC will form an alliance under which the medical centers purchased by BJC will continue to treat patients associated with Conventry.</p>
<p>The deal involves medical centers in the St. Louis area.</p>
